677
00:41:10.677 --> 00:41:11.845
<i>At pagkatapos, ikaw...</i>

678
00:41:12.804 --> 00:41:13.763
<i>Pagkatapos noon...</i>

679
00:41:22.731 --> 00:41:23.607
Dang it.

680
00:41:30.071 --> 00:41:31.448
Jeez...

681
00:41:38.246 --> 00:41:40.706
- May hindi tama, ginoo.
- Ano ngayon?

682
00:41:40.707 --> 00:41:44.710
Matapos makagat si Private Choi,
namatay siya nang hindi naging zombie.

683
00:41:44.711 --> 00:41:45.795
Kaya ano?

684
00:41:46.171 --> 00:41:47.088
Magandang punto.

685
00:41:47.881 --> 00:41:52.677
Naging zombie na yata si Chef Jung
hindi nagtagal ay nakagat siya.

686
00:42:03.063 --> 00:42:04.272
Ano ba yan?

687
00:42:07.067 --> 00:42:08.692
Na-secure mo ba ang pinto?

688
00:42:08.693 --> 00:42:11.238
Sinigurado namin ang hilaga at kanluran
mga access point, sir.

689
00:42:19.454 --> 00:42:21.664
Hindi sila lumingon kaagad.
May delay.

690
00:42:21.665 --> 00:42:22.582
Paano ba naman

691
00:42:35.762 --> 00:42:36.596
Choi...

692
00:42:37.305 --> 00:42:39.139
Choi Chul-woo?

693
00:42:39.140 --> 00:42:40.767
- Chul-woo!
- Huwag kang lalapit sa kanya!

694
00:42:41.142 --> 00:42:43.185
- Chul-woo.
- Hindi ka makakalapit sa kanya.

695
00:42:43.186 --> 00:42:44.187
Pigilan mo siya!

696
00:42:47.232 --> 00:42:48.233
Chul-woo.

697
00:42:56.032 --> 00:42:57.075
anong ginagawa mo

698
00:43:13.758 --> 00:43:15.760
- Hyung-bae.
- Ano ang nangyayari?

699
00:43:21.308 --> 00:43:22.267
Chul-woo.

700
00:43:24.227 --> 00:43:26.688
Sorry sa ginawa ko sayo
gawin ang guillotine choke.

701
00:43:27.230 --> 00:43:28.231
Hyung-bae!

702
00:43:28.815 --> 00:43:29.858
Sir!

703
00:43:37.282 --> 00:43:38.615
Kumuha ng kumot at isang riple.

704
00:43:38.616 --> 00:43:40.117
- Kyung-sik.
- Oo, ginoo.

705
00:43:40.118 --> 00:43:42.161
Corporal Jeon, naririnig mo ba ako?

706
00:43:42.162 --> 00:43:43.662
Okay ka lang ba, Corporal Jeon?

707
00:43:43.663 --> 00:43:45.457
- Corporal Jeon.
- Dalhin mo siya sa loob!

708
00:43:56.134 --> 00:43:57.844
- Unang Sarhento!
- Unang Sarhento!

709
00:44:04.976 --> 00:44:06.644
- Hayaan mo.
- Pribadong Choi.

710
00:44:08.355 --> 00:44:09.271
ayos ka lang ba?

711
00:44:09.272 --> 00:44:10.397
- Chul-woo!
- Si Hyung-bae.

712
00:44:10.398 --> 00:44:11.608
Hyung-bae!

713
00:44:15.487 --> 00:44:17.697
Ibibigay ko ang CPR.
Linisin ang kanyang daanan ng hangin, ginoo.

714
00:44:18.073 --> 00:44:20.657
- I-clear ang kanyang buhok?
- Para sa CPR...

715
00:44:20.658 --> 00:44:22.202
Fucking hell.

716
00:44:22.952 --> 00:44:24.411
Hindi natin siya hahayaang mamatay.

717
00:44:24.412 --> 00:44:25.872
Magiging zombie na siya.

718
00:44:28.291 --> 00:44:32.836
Isa, dalawa, tatlo, apat, lima,
anim, pito, walo, siyam, sampu.

719
00:44:32.837 --> 00:44:36.508
Isa, dalawa, tatlo, apat, lima, anim, pito.

720
00:44:37.133 --> 00:44:39.134
Itigil mo na ang pagdurugo, damn it!

721
00:44:39.135 --> 00:44:40.386
Kumuha ka ng tuwalya!

722
00:44:40.387 --> 00:44:42.638
- Kunin mo ako ng rifle!
- Sino, ako?

723
00:44:42.639 --> 00:44:43.764
Bilisan mo sir!

724
00:44:43.765 --> 00:44:45.392
Kumuha ng riple!

725
00:44:53.441 --> 00:44:54.901
Umalis ka sa daan!

726
00:44:55.318 --> 00:44:57.319
- Handa ka na ba?
- Handa na ako, ginoo.

727
00:44:57.320 --> 00:44:58.488
Sunog!

728
00:45:08.665 --> 00:45:10.124
- Ang ulo.
- Ano?

729
00:45:10.125 --> 00:45:11.583
Kailangan mong barilin ang ulo!

730
00:45:11.584 --> 00:45:12.627
Sunog!

